    """Return 'day', 'month' or 'year' of the instant, taken in UTC."""
    utc = instant.astimezone(timezone.utc)
    return {"day": utc.day, "month": utc.month, "year": utc.year}[part]
"""JSON rendering.

Secret: the JSON document shape, object key ordering and how
values (numbers, timestamps, nulls) are encoded.
